WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.350
A rectangular town,
twelve kilometres by ten,

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.320
with four phone masts.

3
00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.050
Every house connects to its nearest mast.

4
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:12.250
We'll assume the signal gets weaker
the farther you are from that mast.

5
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.640
Colour a few houses by their mast.

6
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:15.910
Some are obvious.

7
00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.030
Others are close calls.

8
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.590
So where in town are you
farthest from every mast,

9
00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.650
the best spot for a new one?

10
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:28.100
In this mission, you'll draw the
perpendicular bisector of two masts:

11
00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.950
the line of points
equally distant from both.

12
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.700
Then you'll split a map into cells.

13
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:37.760
Every point in a cell is nearer
its own mast than any other.

14
00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:41.560
Your mission: find the spot in
town with the weakest signal.
